<title>ROMANIA: RADIO ROMANIA AFTERNOON HEADLINES AT 1 PM.</title>
<headline>RADIO ROMANIA AFTERNOON HEADLINES AT 1 PM.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-05-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Radio Romania news headlines:</p>
<p>* Belgian Prime Minister Jean Luc Dehaene had talks on Friday with his Romanian counterpart Victor Ciorbea.</p>
<p>* Belgium will propose the first wave of NATO expansion to taken in five countries, Romania included, Dehaene said.</p>
<p>* Romanian Prime Minister will start a two-day visit to Luxembourg late on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
